<title>USA: Young and Rubicam wins Army ad contract.</title>
<headline>Young and Rubicam wins Army ad contract.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>New York advertising agency Young and Rubicam Inc. has been awarded a $440.3 million U.S. Army contract to provide recruiting advertising over the next five years, the Army said on Friday.</p>
<p>The big firm has been handling recruiting ads for the Army since 1987 and the latest deal includes a new one year contract with four option years totaling $440.3 million.</p>
</text>
